      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    annual_returns = [0.09, 0.05, 0.08]\n    embedded_gain_pct = 0.10\n    capital_gains_tax_rate = 0.25\n    years = 3\n\n    # Compound the after-tax annual returns, then account for liquidation tax\n    ending_value_before_liquidation = 1.0\n    for annual_return in annual_returns:\n        ending_value_before_liquidation *= 1 + annual_return\n\n    liquidation_tax_pct = embedded_gain_pct * capital_gains_tax_rate\n    ending_value_after_liquidation = ending_value_before_liquidation * (1 - liquidation_tax_pct)\n    annualized_return = ending_value_after_liquidation ** (1 / years) - 1\n\n    # Return the annualized percentage to three decimal places\n    return round(annualized_return * 100, 3)\n```",
